cket of its own, and records every"}]},{"file":"./crates/coder-compositor/Cargo.toml","matches":[{"lineNumber":9,"content":"description = \"The Coder Wayland compositor: dwindle tiling, the bind table, and the desk protocol.\""},{"lineNumber":20,"content":"# The desk protocol's types, in `coder_desk::protocol`, and its server:"}]},{"file":"./crates/claude_agent_sdk/Cargo.toml","matches":[{"lineNumber":3,"content":"description = \"Rust port of the Claude Agent SDK wire protocol: drives the Claude Code CLI over stream-json and its control protocol\""}]},{"file":"./crates/coder-access/Cargo.toml","matches":[{"lineNumber":26,"content":"# The relay clients. A browser build keeps the protocol, studio, and review"}]},{"file":"./crates/verse/Cargo.toml","matches":[{"lineNumber":104,"content":"# The control protocol the studio reaches a host on this computer with."}]},{"file":"./crates/openagents-desktop/Cargo.toml","matches":[{"lineNumber":73,"content":"# The control protocol's messages."}]},{"file":"./crates/openagents-connect/Cargo.toml","matches":[{"lineNumber":7,"content":"description = \"Connect a phone to a computer over iroh: the endpoint, the enroll and reach ALPNs, the openagents-connect: QR payload, and the local control protocol.\""}]},{"file":"./crates/openagents-cli/Cargo.toml","matches":[{"lineNumber":40,"content":"# `openagents connect`: the local control protocol and the connect code."}]}],"totalLines":19,"totalMatchedLines":19,"headLimitApplied":30}}}}}}

