data: {"type":"tool-call-started","callId":"call-13de1bab-639f-4d68-8bac-31cce9a5c3c9-117\nfc_b9ee31b9-5a98-9c85-acf5-f6c1e142e081_1","toolCall":{"type":"task","args":{"description":"Verify environment build","prompt":"Verify a Cloud Agent environment build for the OpenAgents repository. Do not modify the repository, do not commit, do not push, do not open pull requests, and do not call production endpoints or mutate external services.\n\nThis VM should have booted from environment build bld-20261008-26522d23-d3aa-427c-b6f2-3fc6ffbabdb8. There is no start script. A missing /tmp/cursor/start-user/ directory is expected. Do not start services by hand.\n\nDo all of the following and return a short report:\n\n1. Report the requested build identity if it is visible (environment variables, files under /tmp, or similar). Say if it is not visible.\n2. Print versions: `rustc --version`, `cargo --version`, `cargo fmt --version`, `cargo clippy --version`, `python3 --version`, `protoc --version`, `pkg-config --modversion openssl`, `pkg-config --modversion sqlite3`, `bwrap --version`, `git --version`. Note any missing command.\n3. From /workspace, run `cargo fetch --locked --offline` and report the exit code. This proves the root workspace crates were fetched during install.\n4. Run this test, which creates and refuses a corrupt lease table (a real local action, no network):\n\nCARGO_TARGET_DIR=$HOME/work/openagents-target-verify CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=2 cargo test --offline -p coder-lease --lib a_corrupt_table_is_an_error_not_a_reset\n\nIf that filter matches nothing, run:\n\nCARGO_TARGET_DIR=$HOME/work/openagents-target-verify CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=2 cargo test --offline -p atif --lib this_crate_writes_the_newest_version_it_reads\n\nInclude the `test result:` line and the exit code.\n5. Confirm /tmp/cursor/start-user/ is absent (no start script) and that you did not start a server.\n\nReturn only the report: build identity, versions, fetch exit code, test result line, and start-directory observation.","subagentType":{"kind":"unspecified"},"model":"grok-4.7-high-fast","agentId":"bc-3a90601a-d753-5a94-8be4-6fb84bda6279","mode":"unspecified"}},"modelCallId":"call-13de1bab-639f-4d68-8bac-31cce9a5c3c9-117\nfc_b9ee31b9-5a98-9c85-acf5-f6c1e142e081_1"}

